      "updated_at": "2025-12-07T21:27:08Z",
      "body": "Based on the feedback from @manuel-rw I propose the following changes:\n1. Auto Layout automatically gets between 5 and 7 layouts at creation (How the breakpoints and amount of columns look like has to be defined)\n2. Custom layout gets a new switch which allows the user to enable automatic sizing & positioning while manually adjusting layouts\n a) If auto size & position is enabled, base layout can be selected\n\nWhat changes are required for the db etc. I'll have to further analyse, I'll do so in the next few days",
