      "updated_at": "2025-12-17T07:09:40Z",
      "body": "I would propose another change:\nThe user should be able to choose which layout he can change and is used as base layout. So if the user uses a mobile phone he does not need to change the 10 column layout. There are two possible solutions I currently have:\n1. The user can only choose between Mobile and Desktop and has to adjust these specific layouts OR\n2. The user can choose any of the available Layouts which however all have a descriptive name and description. \n\nAdditionally the label of the input wouldn't be base layout and rather something like **Edit layout** with the description:\n> Choose which of the following layouts you want to configure",
