      "created_at": "2026-01-06T21:17:22Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-01-06T21:17:31Z",
      "body": ">  configure the default layout and the algorithm does the rest of the work.   \n\nDefinitely the way to go. Personally I would add this selection in the onboarding as a last step to jump-start with a dashboard instead of \"create your first board\" . You select the design one you think looks the best and it creates a default dashboard with that layout (already populated with many default apps/integrations/widgets) \n\nMobile should be secondary as it is 20.2% of traffic (from umami avg 7 days). Mobile is too narrow to be ordered properly, just make the widgets be at top one after the other and each takes the full width of the device. Then scroll below to see the apps in a grid manner respective to the screen's width ",
